                        "title":  "The ground becomes a surface: the painter, the first crash, and a word that overflows",
                        "about":  "Every square of the lattice is filled now, painted far to near so each one covers what was behind it - the painter\u0027s algorithm, which is lesson 15\u0027s table read backwards. The skyline array and five line routines are gone. A filled hillside ends the flight. Twice the view distance overflowed a 16-bit word when the square block turned 45 degrees, so the view became a circle. Then three speed-ups, each measured: 19 to 27 frames, and one of them bought almost nothing",
